#: NAVIGATION.md:81
msgid ""
"We then verified our observations with a larger system being simulated which"
" was in its spirit similar to our target simulation. We observed that with "
"larger simulation, the overhead of PLUMED was further reduced. This affirmed"
" us that going forward when simulations are going to become larger, the "
"overhead of PLUMED will reduce and overall benefit of offloading PLUMED to "
"GPUs may deliver diminishing returns especially considering the effort and "
"technical effort needed to achieve it."
msgstr ""
"次に、対象と同様の性質を持つ、より大きな系のシミュレーションでも結果を検証した。シミュレーションが大きくなると、PLUMED の Overhead "
"はさらに減少した。この結果から、今後シミュレーションがさらに大規模になるにつれ、PLUMED の Overhead は小さくなり、GPU "
"Offloading 全体の利点も小さくなる可能性があると考えられる。特に、実現に必要な労力や技術的作業を考慮する必要がある。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:83
msgid "TL;DR"
msgstr "要点"

